d the CARO annexure are not routed to this reader, so no litigation evidence was available. Absence here is OUR coverage gap, not a statement that the company has no litigation."},"mdna":"Water scarcity is named as the defining structural driver of demand: India supports close to 18% of the world's population but holds only about 4% of its freshwater resources, and per-capita availability is declining from roughly 1,486 cubic metres in 2021 toward about 1,140 cubic metres by 2050|Public capital expenditure is the sector's principal demand engine: the Ministry of Jal Shakti was allocated about Rs 99,503 crore in the FY2025-26 Union Budget, channelled through four flagship pillars that 'map directly onto the Company's addressable market'|Jal Jeevan Mission extended to 2028 as …","objects":null,"oem":"","one_liner":"JITF Infralogistics Limited is the listed holding company for the infrastructure vertical of the O.P. Jindal Group, operating India's largest waste-to-energy platform (JUIL) and a holistic water-management EPC platform (JWIL) through a network of subsidiaries, step-down subsidiaries and SPVs.","peer_panel":{"asof":"2026-08-14","industry":"Other Utilities","peers":[{"ebitda_margin":12.1,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"7y CAGR","mcap":7632,"name":"VA TECH WABAG LTD","pat":369.8,"pat_growth":19.7,"pe":20.6,"rev":3944.2,"rev_growth":5.1,"s":"WABAG","source":"product","why":"shares infrastructure/plants/services/water"},{"ebitda_margin":15.9,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"6y CAGR","mcap":2996,"name":"REFEX INDUSTRIES LTD","pat":203.7,"pat_growth":36.4,"pe":14.7,"rev":2276.7,"rev_growth":30.5,"s":"REFEX","source":"product","why":"shares logistics/services"},{"ebitda_margin":24.2,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"2y CAGR","mcap":2475,"name":"ENVIRO INFRA ENGINEERS LIMITED","pat":188.4,"pat_growth":31.8,"pe":13.1,"rev":1145.6,"rev_growth":25.4,"s":"EIEL","source":"product","why":"shares plants/projects/services/water"},{"ebitda_margin":19.5,"fy":"FY26","growth_basis":"6y CAGR",